{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24229","headline":"初夏闲吟兼呈韦宾客 · 白居易","name":"初夏闲吟兼呈韦宾客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孟夏清和月，东都闲散官。\n体中无病痛，眼下未饥寒。\n世事闻常闷，交游见即欢。\n杯觞留客切，妓乐取人宽。\n雪鬓随身老，云心着处安。\n此中殊有味，试说向君看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}